---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout title="About | Ratan Dhanjal">
  <div class="container page-container fade-in">
    <header class="page-header stagger-1">
      <h1 class="font-serif">About Me</h1>
      <p class="subtitle">Who I am and what drives me.</p>
    </header>

    <div class="content-grid">
      <div class="main-content stagger-2">
        <h2>Professional Journey</h2>
        <p>
          I'm Ratan Dhanjal, a Cloud and DevOps Engineer with over 7 years of experience in the tech industry. My journey began in networking and IT support, eventually leading me to specialize in cloud infrastructure and automation. I've spent significant time architecting solutions on Azure, focusing on Infrastructure as Code (IaC) with Terraform and container orchestration with Kubernetes.
        </p>
        <p>
          Throughout my career at companies like Sopra Steria, Reliance PPM, and Valu Connex, I've developed a passion for building reliable, scalable systems that solve real business problems. I believe in automation, continuous learning, and writing clean, maintainable code.
        </p>
        
        <h2>Philosophy</h2>
        <p>
          Technology is a tool to empower people. I approach engineering with a product mindset—focusing not just on how something is built, but why it's built and who it serves. My design philosophy heavily influences my technical work: I prefer minimal, elegant solutions over complex workarounds.
        </p>

        <h2>Beyond the Screen</h2>
        <p>
          When I'm not writing code or configuring infrastructure, you can find me exploring new technologies, reading books, or traveling. This website serves as my digital journal to document these experiences and the lessons I learn along the way.
        </p>
      </div>

      <aside class="sidebar stagger-3">
        <div class="card glass-effect">
          <h3>Quick Facts</h3>
          <ul class="fact-list">
            <li><strong>Location:</strong> India</li>
            <li><strong>Experience:</strong> 7+ Years</li>
            <li><strong>Focus:</strong> Azure, Terraform, DevOps</li>
            <li><strong>Interests:</strong> Tech, Reading, Travel</li>
          </ul>
        </div>
      </aside>
    </div>
  </div>
</Layout>

<style>
  .page-container {
    padding-top: var(--space-2xl);
    padding-bottom: var(--space-4xl);
  }

  .page-header {
    margin-bottom: var(--space-3xl);
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border-color);
    padding-bottom: var(--space-xl);
  }

  .font-serif {
    font-family: var(--font-serif);
    font-size: 3rem;
    margin-bottom: var(--space-sm);
  }

  .subtitle {
    color: var(--text-secondary);
    font-size: 1.25rem;
    margin: 0;
  }

  .content-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 2fr 1fr;
    gap: var(--space-3xl);
  }

  .main-content h2 {
    font-family: var(--font-serif);
    margin-top: var(--space-2xl);
    margin-bottom: var(--space-md);
    font-size: 1.75rem;
  }
  
  .main-content h2:first-child {
    margin-top: 0;
  }

  .main-content p {
    font-size: 1.05rem;
    line-height: 1.8;
    color: var(--text-secondary);
    margin-bottom: var(--space-lg);
  }

  .sidebar .card {
    background-color: var(--bg-color-secondary);
    border: 1px solid var(--border-color);
    border-radius: var(--radius-lg);
    padding: var(--space-xl);
    position: sticky;
    top: 100px;
  }

  .sidebar h3 {
    margin-top: 0;
    margin-bottom: var(--space-lg);
    font-family: var(--font-serif);
  }

  .fact-list {
    list-style: none;
    padding: 0;
    margin: 0;
  }

  .fact-list li {
    padding: var(--space-sm) 0;
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border-color);
    color: var(--text-secondary);
    font-size: 0.95rem;
  }

  .fact-list li:last-child {
    border-bottom: none;
  }

  .fact-list strong {
    color: var(--text-color);
    font-weight: 500;
  }

  .stagger-1, .stagger-2, .stagger-3 {
    opacity: 0;
    animation: slideUp var(--transition-slow) forwards;
  }

  @media (max-width: 768px) {
    .content-grid {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    }
  }
</style>
